{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.52},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.4,"end":28.72},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.847,"end":36.72}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.76,"text":"都市鋪面改變雨水能滲入或累積的位置。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.24,"end":7.84,"text":"模型把降雨分配到入滲、蓄水與逕流。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.32,"end":9.52,"text":"它是規劃示意，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.92,"end":13.52,"text":"沒有真實排水網、土壤調查或洪水預報。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.4,"end":19.44,"text":"設定降雨 60 mm、透水地表 30%、蓄水 10 mm，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.16,"end":23.04,"text":"檢查立即計算的水量收支輸出。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.68,"end":24.96,"text":"辨認水的去向，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.04,"end":26.08,"text":"不只看逕流。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.64,"end":28.72,"text":"水量收支必須交代什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.847,"end":29.973,"text":"水量收支必須交代什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30,"end":33.6,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.16,"end":36.72,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}